<title>NETHERLANDS: SCHUTTERSVELD NINE-MONTHS NET UP 13 PCT.</title>
<headline>SCHUTTERSVELD NINE-MONTHS NET UP 13 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     4.09 vs   3.72</p>
<p>    Net profit			    18.3  vs  16.2</p>
<p>    Turnover			     710    vs 598</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial and services group Schuttersveld Holding</p>
<p>NV said in August it expected a 1996 second-half net profit at</p>
<p>about the same level as the 14.9 million guilders posted in the</p>
<p>first half of the year. In 1995, the company's full-year net</p>
<p>rose by 36 percent to 25.2 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
